  "notes": "Corrects the section-tab proportions: the Editor category selectors are now tall, skinny upright tabs attached to and slightly protruding from the left edge instead of wide sidebar rectangles. Text Boxes / Inputs now uses compact numbered tabs (1, 2, 3, 4, etc.); hovering a number shows the full text-box/input name, and the selected item name appears above its controls. Keeps the reorganized Text groups, browser-style workspaces, multi-skin tabs, and all prior tools."
